{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 208,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There is a problem that I can't bring up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2335,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without starting a fight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3670,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No, what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4629,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It just seems so obvious to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6214,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now I'm all screwed up, man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7549,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Casper laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8550,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It has infiltrated every\nsingle Veritasium meeting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11386,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the last two months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12595,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's trivial. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13805,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I didn't think\nyou would fall for this side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15432,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Just makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16266,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Let's go!\n- That's crazy!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18601,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And I even argued with Derek about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20812,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's no way you're\ntrying to convince me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23523,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't care."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24691,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, here's the setup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26776,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You walk into a room,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28111,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's a supercomputer\nand two boxes on the table."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31156,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One box is open, and\nit's got $1,000 in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34200,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(cash register ka-chings)\nThere's no trick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35577,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know it's $1,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37662,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other box is a mystery\nbox, you can't see inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41458,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You also know that this supercomputer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43460,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is very good at predicting people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45378,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has correctly predicted the choices"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47255,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of thousands of people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48548,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the exact problem you're about to face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51092,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you don't know what\nthat problem is yet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53887,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you do know that it has\nbeen correct almost every time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57849,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the supercomputer says\nyou can either take both boxes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61186,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is the mystery box and the $1,000,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64439,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or you can just take the mystery box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67108,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what's in that mystery box?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69194,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the supercomputer tells you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70779,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that before you walked into the room,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73281,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it made a prediction about your choice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76034,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the supercomputer predicted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77535,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would just take the mystery box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79412,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'd leave the $1,000 on the table,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81915,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, then it put $1 million\n(cash register ka-chings)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84042,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the mystery box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85543,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if the supercomputer predicted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87796,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you would take both boxes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90006,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then it put nothing in the mystery box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93343,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The supercomputer made its prediction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95136,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before you knew about the problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97514,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it has already set up the boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99641,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not trying to trick you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101309,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not trying to\ndeprive you of any money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103812,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its only goal is to make\nthe correct prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107315,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what do you do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108399,
    "dDurationMs": 4422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you take both boxes or do\nyou just take the mystery box?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112821,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't worry about how the supercomputer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114823,
    "dDurationMs": 1459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is making its prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116282,
    "dDurationMs": 1085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of a computer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117367,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could think of it as\na super intelligent alien,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119953,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a cunning demon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121371,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or even a team of the\nworld's best psychologists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124415,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really doesn't matter who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125959,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or what is making the prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127836,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All you need to know is that\nthey are extremely accurate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131214,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that they made that prediction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132882,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before you walked into the room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135260,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pause the video now if you\nwant to think about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137345,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(soft playful music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141808,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Got your answer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143393,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, I should just take\ntwo boxes, like, obviously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146354,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm gonna say I'm just\ngonna take the $1 million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148481,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and go with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149315,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Of course you take two boxes!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151067,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I would pick both boxes, I think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152861,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I would not get the two boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154112,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think I'm taking both boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155780,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Let's go!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156656,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(interviewee laughs)\nOkay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157490,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is seeming less\nparadoxical than I thought"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160034,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I should just go in\nand take the mystery box only."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163663,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165248,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166666,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There are two camps,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168251,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one-boxers who would take\nonly the mystery box,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171045,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and two-boxers who take both."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174007,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as American philosopher\nRobert Nozick wrote,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176384,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"To almost everyone, it is perfectly clear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178761,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and obvious what should be done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180513,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The difficulty is that these people seem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182724,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to divide almost evenly on the problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184934,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with large numbers thinking\nthat the opposite half"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187604,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is just being silly.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189522,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as Newcomb's paradox,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191816,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "named for its inventor, William Newcomb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194569,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Guardian newspaper\npolled over 31,000 people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197739,
    "dDurationMs": 1751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about this problem in 2016."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199490,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "53.5% were one-boxers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202035,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and 46.5% were two-boxers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205455,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if you find it hard to see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207081,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why anyone would pick the opposite side,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209542,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, here are the\narguments for each camp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213171,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Look, I'm a reasonable\nguy and I like money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215798,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'm gonna do whatever\ngets me the most money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218384,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, let's go weigh the outcomes\nof both of these decisions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222138,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, I'm gonna say that the probability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224098,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the computer predicted\nmy decision correctly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226643,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is gonna be C, so the\ncomputer got it right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229729,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because of that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230605,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the probability it got it\nwrong is gonna be 1 - C."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234651,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, let's look at what\nhappens if I try to two-box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236611,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a C chance of me getting $1,000"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239948,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a 1 - C chance of\nme getting $1,001,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243618,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I add these two together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245036,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I get a weighted sum,\nwhich is gonna tell me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247121,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much I can expect to\nget if I try to two-box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250166,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is also known as expected utility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252919,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the EU of two-boxing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255463,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can just simplify\nthis expression a tiny bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258091,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, let's look at what happens\nif I try to one-box now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260301,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a C chance of\nme getting $1 million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262887,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's a 1 - C chance\nof me getting nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265556,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, we can cancel this out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267308,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simplify this to just $1 million times C."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271271,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I equate these two expressions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273106,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna get the C"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274065,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at which these two expected\nutilities are equal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276818,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it turns out that the\nC at which this happens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279362,
    "dDurationMs": 4963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is 0.5005, or 50.05%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284325,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which means if the computer is better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286995,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at predicting than what\nis basically random,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290290,
    "dDurationMs": 3878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the expected utility of\none-boxing is gonna be higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294168,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I know that the\ncomputer is much better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296045,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at predicting than that\nbecause it accurately predicted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298589,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thousands of people before me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300675,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which means I'm sticking with my one box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304220,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's my $1 million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305930,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take that, Casper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307140,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you very much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309100,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, I should go in\nand take the mystery box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310852,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and leave the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311853,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Cause I'm assuming that its\nprediction is pretty good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313855,
    "dDurationMs": 1042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a supercomputer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314897,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, so you're saying\nit's not paradoxical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317066,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the choice is obvious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318484,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm very surprised."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319652,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Why?\n- Because to me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320611,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the answer is also obvious,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322363,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to me, the answer\nis you take both boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325116,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, here's how I think about the problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326951,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a way that actually makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328995,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know that the supercomputer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330204,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has already set up the boxes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331748,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so whatever I decide to do now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333583,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it doesn't change whether there's zero"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335501,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or $1 million in that mystery box,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338087,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that gives us four possible options"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340548,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I've written down here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341799,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If there is $0 in a mystery box,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344177,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I could one-box and get $0"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346596,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or I could two-box and get $1,000,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349724,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there could also be $1\nmillion in a mystery box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352602,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in that case, I would\nget $1 million if I one-box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356105,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or I would get $1,001,000 if I two-box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360193,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I'm always better off\nby picking both boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363488,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as strategic dominance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365406,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where I always pick the dominant strategy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368159,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which in this case is to two-box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371496,
    "dDurationMs": 2168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, give me those boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373664,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The two-boxer argument\nmakes a lot of sense to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376626,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once you explain it, I'm like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378211,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Okay, yeah, I can see\nwhy exactly you're right.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381881,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I can also see that just having"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384133,
    "dDurationMs": 1502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those thoughts in your brain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385635,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are what might allow the\ncomputer to give you nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388388,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I'm grateful that I\njust don't have those thoughts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391933,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's so funny because I\nwas totally expecting you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395436,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to go two box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396604,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397438,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No way, man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398564,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like there are two\nperfectly reasonable approaches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401692,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that give two completely\ndifferent answers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404654,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's because your choice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406239,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually reveals something fundamental"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408032,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about how you make decisions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410076,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It comes down to these two statements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412703,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, as far as you\nknow, basically everyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415123,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who has taken one box has\nwalked away a millionaire,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418209,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and everyone who has taken\ntwo has walked away poor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421963,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, the supercomputer\nmade its prediction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424507,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before you even knew about the problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427343,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The boxes are already set up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429220,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so your decision now can't change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431931,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if the million is in there or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434475,
    "dDurationMs": 1669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both of these statements are true,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436144,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there's a hidden assumption\nin each that divides people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440273,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We pick both and the\ncomputer picks both?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443109,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You just get the $1,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444861,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think I would just\npick the mystery box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446112,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Just the mystery box, probably."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447905,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah.\n- I might be taking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449323,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the mystery box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450616,
    "dDurationMs": 1043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Just the mystery box?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451659,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, it might be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452952,
    "dDurationMs": 1043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454829,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I don't know, I guess the\nsupercomputer is right, no?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458249,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Here's the hidden\nassumption for us one-boxers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460585,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My expected utility calculations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462587,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are based on probabilities\nthat are using prior evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465756,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of how accurate the supercomputer is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468134,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the thousands of people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469927,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it accurately predicted before me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472054,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is evidence enough for me\nthat when I go for one box,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476017,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's gonna be $1 million\nwaiting in there for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478853,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is based on something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480188,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called evidential decision theory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482398,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And using this decision theory,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484150,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get these expected utilities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486402,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my choice is obvious from there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490031,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it turns out a lot of you\nactually thought the same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492533,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We polled our audience, got\nmore than 24,000 responses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496412,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it turns out two thirds\nof you are one-boxers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499665,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I know, it's crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501417,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't trust this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502335,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's looking to be like you're less"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503711,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and less rational with\nthese results, Casper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505838,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, your argument is kind\nof that if you one-box,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508758,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will have predicted\nthat you were gonna one-box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510801,
    "dDurationMs": 1711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'll walk out with the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512512,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is pretty convincing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514138,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Casper, I'm starting to really doubt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515306,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this two box side of things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516849,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How could you not be a two-boxer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519560,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gregor has this really funny\nway of thinking about things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522438,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I make my decision\nbased off something else,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525149,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something a little more rational"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526984,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I believe that whatever I do now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529695,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can't influence and change the past."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532156,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I only take into account things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533950,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I can actually influence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535952,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And clearly, whatever I do\nnow, whatever I think now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539413,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not gonna change\nwhether that $1 million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541374,
    "dDurationMs": 1751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is gonna be in the mystery box or not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543125,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it was already set up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544835,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before I learned about the problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547088,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as causal decision theory,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549090,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you only take into account things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550800,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you can actually cause."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552802,
    "dDurationMs": 1042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, with this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553844,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your expected utility calculation changes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556430,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's because you need to\nuse a different probability,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559475,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one where you could actually\ncause that $1 million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562687,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be in the mystery box or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564730,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, right before the\nsupercomputer made its prediction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567858,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was some probability that it thought"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570361,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was going to one-box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572029,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know, it's weird, but bear with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574031,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, let's say that probability is P,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576826,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then that's the probability\nthat I'm going to use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579036,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in my expected utility calculation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581289,
    "dDurationMs": 1876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the expected utility to one-box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583165,
    "dDurationMs": 4964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is just gonna be 0 + $1 million times P."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588129,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's pretty good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589380,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the expected utility for two-boxing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591549,
    "dDurationMs": 5005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is gonna be $1,000 + $1 million times P."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597013,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's just the same\nas the expected utility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599265,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for one-boxing plus an extra $1,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602643,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, no matter what the computer predicted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604812,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my expected utility is always\nhigher by picking both boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609275,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, of course, you're gonna two-box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610776,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyone in their right mind\nwould pick both boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613571,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's made the prediction\nbefore you're in there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616115,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether I have facing this\nthing being 90%, 100%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618909,
    "dDurationMs": 1419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it actually doesn't really matter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620328,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think you guys are imposing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621454,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your will on-\n- Yes, it does!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622663,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- He's cooking, bro."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623789,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, yeah, you guys\nthink that your decision,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626459,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whatever you think now\nis gonna change the past."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629045,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's called wishful thinking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630755,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, like, come on, I'm two boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632590,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm two boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633424,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It only makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634508,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm back with Casper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635676,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Exactly, welcome to\ncamp two-boxers. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639180,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm not losing $1 million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640514,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was never in the room, man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641807,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're gonna walk into a room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642683,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's either money in the room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643601,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or there isn't money in the room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644435,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your question is, do you pick it up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645770,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646604,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We're trying to do you a favor here!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648397,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You're not doing me a favor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649315,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause your decision\nmaking does not affect..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652109,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, your little thought does\nnot change God's mind, bro."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654779,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Henry, if you convinced\nyourself that you're a one-boxer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658115,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you've convinced the machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660117,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I don't believe that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661118,
    "dDurationMs": 1085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What do you mean you don't-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662203,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I don't believe you convincing yourself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663788,
    "dDurationMs": 2168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should impact what the\nmachine thinks of you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665956,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because often, you're\njust walking into a room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667541,
    "dDurationMs": 1085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's already made the prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668626,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't impact it, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670711,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, whatever you\nthink is more important,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672672,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether that's the evidence of\nthe supercomputer's accuracy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675549,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the fact that the\nboxes are already set up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678469,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, that affects how you\ncalculate the expected utility."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681972,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because both of those\nassumptions are true,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684433,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both camps have valid answers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686977,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if there's no right answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688437,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then is this just a meaningless problem?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690731,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, not really."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692274,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it actually\nreveals a surprising amount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694694,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about three important questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697029,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does free will exist?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698948,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What does it mean to be rational?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700908,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And is there an ideal way to act in life?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704453,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, the only way\nyou're going to win this game"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707498,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to already be the\nkind of person to one-box,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710751,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then two-box at the\nlast second anyways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712837,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the only way you're\ngonna get $1,001,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717216,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But some would argue that\nthat itself is impossible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720803,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the predictor is so good,\nlet's say it's 100% accurate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724598,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then that's not even possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726809,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would you say that's true?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727810,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729311,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Then a follow-up question is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731230,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if such a perfect predictor would exist,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733649,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does that mean that\nfree will doesn't exist?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737111,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because you're saying\nthere's nothing you can do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739029,
    "dDurationMs": 4797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in between walking into that\nroom and making your decision"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743826,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that ends up changing\nwhat was predetermined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747496,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's right, and maybe this reveals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749081,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where I'm coming from,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750624,
    "dDurationMs": 1127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think where I'm coming from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751751,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is maybe free will doesn't exist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753419,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I come down in this point of\nlike free will is an illusion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756756,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but our world operates in a way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759759,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is indistinguishable\nfrom free will being real,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763721,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore, you have to\nact as though it's real,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766932,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as though it's 100% real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769059,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770019,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If we think that free will is not real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772688,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's an illusion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773981,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you have someone\nwho's committing crimes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776233,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you wanna say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777109,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Well, that's not his fault.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778569,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, instead of putting, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781238,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "murderers in jail for 25 years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783324,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're just gonna give them\nsome gardening classes or so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786202,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, the problem is, that\nthen changes the environment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789663,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where everyone knows you can kill someone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791749,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can go to, like, do the gardening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793417,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you can't change the system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794960,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "based on the knowledge\nthat it's an illusion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796962,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether we do or don't have free will,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798506,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to live as though it exists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800925,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, you've still gotta make a choice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802802,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one box or two boxes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805471,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which brings us to our second question,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808140,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what does it mean to be rational?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810184,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm the guy who acted rationally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812102,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and doesn't believe his\nthoughts can influence the past."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815189,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But your rational choice\nwill have given you a $1,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819318,
    "dDurationMs": 1502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I know, yeah, it's tough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820820,
    "dDurationMs": 1042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's tough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821862,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Gregor] Let's see what\nI can buy with $1 million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824323,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of these look great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825533,
    "dDurationMs": 1459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we can be more creative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826992,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Private island sounds pretty nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828744,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- All right, Casper,\nwhat do you wanna go buy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830204,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with 1,000, man?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831622,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Casper laughs)\n(Henry laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833082,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] This is known"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833916,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the \"Why Ain'cha Rich?\" argument,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835876,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which boils down to one\nsuper annoying question,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839296,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you're so smart, then why ain'cha rich?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842466,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, if winning\nis getting more money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844301,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then of course the one-boxers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845761,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are gonna end up better\noff than the two-boxers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848472,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But maybe it's not about who wins,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850683,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but about what's rational."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852726,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In their 1978 paper,\nphilosophers Gibbard and Harper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856355,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "argue that the rational\nchoice is to pick both boxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859817,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Although they do admit that\ntwo-boxers will fare worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863195,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They instead say that the game is rigged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865781,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And \"if someone is very\ngood at predicting behavior"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868450,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and rewards predicted\nirrationality richly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871203,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then irrationality will\nbe richly rewarded.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874456,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think that's a bit of a cop out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876375,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because really, Newcomb's paradox"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878168,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reveals something surprising,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880421,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sometimes in order\nto be a rational person,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883716,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you must act irrationally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886218,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's one question of\nwhat's a rational person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888762,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's another question\nof what's a rational act."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 891265,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of the time, rational\npeople do rational acts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894643,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sometimes they just don't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895936,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think this is analogous"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898314,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the situation in\nthe prisoner's dilemma."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901984,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] In the prisoner's dilemma,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903193,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you and another player compete for money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905321,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by either cooperating or defecting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907781,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you both cooperate,\n(audio chimes)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909366,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you get three coins each.\n(coins clinking)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911076,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you defect\n(audio chimes)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912202,
    "dDurationMs": 1669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and your opponent cooperates,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913871,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you get five coins\n(coins clinking)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915331,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they get nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916874,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you both defect,\n(buzzer buzzes)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918125,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get one coin each.\n(coins clink)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919793,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, no matter what your opponent does,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921795,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you are always better off by defecting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924715,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you play this game not once,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926800,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but repeatedly, then everything changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929470,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of a sudden, you're\nbetter off by cooperating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932806,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What's a rational society?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934516,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A rational society is full of cooperators."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937519,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's a rational person?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939313,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe a rational person is a defector."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941607,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And normally, you might\nexpect a rational society"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944735,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is made up of rational people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946236,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think it's familiar\nthat rationality at one level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949156,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "isn't compatible with\nrationality at the other level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951575,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, while the rational\nact is the two box,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953953,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a rational society would\nactually be full of one-boxers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957581,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I'm a fervent two-boxer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959541,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there are three ways that\nyou can get me to one-box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963420,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is if my choices now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965172,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can actually change the past."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966715,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, say the\nsupercomputer makes its prediction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969426,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by opening up some tiny\nwormhole to see the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972554,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, in that case, if\nI choose one box now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974556,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that actually causes the $1 million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976475,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be placed in there in\nthe past, so I one-box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979937,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, if there are multiple trials,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982064,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because now with every game,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983482,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each of my choices builds up\na reputation, so if I one-box,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987152,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I'll be predicted as the\nkind of person to one-box,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989780,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so I get the $1 million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991240,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "either in this round or a later one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993158,
    "dDurationMs": 1836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And third is, if I can pre-commit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994994,
    "dDurationMs": 1584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I can talk to the computer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996578,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make my case before\nit makes its prediction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999289,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I will 100% one-box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000874,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because staying true to my\nword is important to me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003335,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the supercomputer would know that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005045,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If I put my word on it,\nI'll take the one box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007506,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, 100% one box, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010342,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But there are some realistic scenarios"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012261,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where staying true to a worse option"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014013,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could have deadly consequences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016557,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the 29th of August, 1949,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018726,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Soviet Union detonated the RDS-1 bomb"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022021,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as part of their first\nnuclear weapons test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024648,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This sent the US and the USSR\ninto a furious arms race."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028944,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the mid-1960s, the US had\nover 30,000 nuclear warheads,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033073,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the USSR had just over 6,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036035,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both sides were more than capable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037953,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of destroying the other.\n(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040414,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The US Secretary of Defense\nat the time, Robert McNamara,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043500,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "didn't advocate for disarmament."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045544,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, he recommended a\nstrategy of \"assured destruction,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049506,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the US should be able"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050799,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to deter a deliberate nuclear attack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053177,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by \"maintaining a highly reliable ability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055679,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to inflict an unacceptable degree"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057765,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of damage upon any single aggressor.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060726,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This strategy eventually became known"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062519,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as mutually assured destruction, or MAD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065814,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If either country attacked first,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067733,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the other would surely retaliate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069318,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and lead to total annihilation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071111,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of both sides.\n(explosion booms)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073238,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, having that commitment\nto retaliate is beneficial."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076700,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It stops the attack from\nhappening in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080287,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now, say you are the US\npresident during the Cold War."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083499,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have publicly committed to retaliate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085626,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if the US is ever attacked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087669,
    "dDurationMs": 1419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you've just received word"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089088,
    "dDurationMs": 2168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the Soviets have\nlaunched their missiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091256,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not a system error,\nit is a real attack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094259,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what do you do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095886,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you launch now, then at best,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097888,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everyone in the US and USSR dies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100557,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at worst, you get a nuclear winter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102476,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that kills nearly everyone on the planet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104937,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Everyone in the whole world dies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106647,
    "dDurationMs": 1751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I probably don't launch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108398,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But you did pre-commit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110192,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111068,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't like the outcome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112277,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No, it's terrible.\n- I don't like the outcome"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114530,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of everyone on Earth dying,\nso I'm gonna just not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117491,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When the country is\nelecting their leader,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120661,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which leader do you want to elect?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122162,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you want to elect someone who's crazy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124331,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and is always gonna press that button,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126291,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or do you wanna elect someone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128043,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who makes the seemingly\nrational choice of saving people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131046,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and not press that button?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132506,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think you want someone\nwho maintains the posture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136176,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of always pushing that button."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138554,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's right.\n- And then you want someone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140848,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who secretly will not\nactually push that button."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1143684,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There is an inherent risk there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146270,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is that if anyone\nfinds out, you're exposed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149982,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's this other\ngame theory interaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151984,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the game they call chicken."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153068,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're both driving\nyour cars at each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154862,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The worst thing is if\nneither of you swerves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156822,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because then you both die,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1158073,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you win if the other\nperson swerves and you don't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161285,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The best strategy in this game"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1163829,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to visibly take the\nsteering wheel out of your car"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167040,
    "dDurationMs": 1127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and throw it out the window"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168167,
    "dDurationMs": 2168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that the opponent can\nsee that you've done that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170335,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now they know you cannot swerve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172921,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're this mad dog that's\njust going straight ahead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176216,
    "dDurationMs": 1043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now they realize,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1177259,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Now my best action is just to swerve.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179553,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that similarly, like what you want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181805,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the nuclear deterrent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183682,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as they set up in \"Dr. Strangelove.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1185976,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In the 1963 film, \"Dr. Strangelove or:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188729,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How I Learned to Stop\nWorrying and Love the Bomb,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191106,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Russians built the\nperfect doomsday device."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194067,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As soon as it detects a nuclear\nattack or any tampering,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197279,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it automatically triggers a\nlarge enough nuclear explosion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200365,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to kill everyone on the planet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202618,
    "dDurationMs": 2168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tampering kill switch isn't there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204786,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to prevent enemies from disabling it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206830,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's to prevent the Russians themselves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1208624,
    "dDurationMs": 1876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from having second thoughts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210500,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the whole point of the\ndevice is to be so devastating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213253,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and automatic that the\nUS would never even think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216381,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about launching an attack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1218175,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this only works if everyone knows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220385,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the device exists,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222387,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is the whole point of the movie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224556,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In both Newcomb's paradox and MAD,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226683,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the best outcome follows\nfrom a pre-commitment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229144,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a worse option."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230729,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what gets you at least\n$1 million in the former"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1233732,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a tense but stable\npeace in the latter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1236068,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the commitment that's important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238362,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, maybe being rational isn't deciding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240906,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about what to choose in the moment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1243075,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's about deciding what\nrules you're going to live by."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246536,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The question isn't how to act."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1248538,
    "dDurationMs": 3713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The question is what rules one ought to follow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252251,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or how does one even decide\nwhat rules to follow?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1254503,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes it's put in the form of,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1256588,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you knew that you were\na robot with programming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1260801,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you could set and\nyou could rewire yourself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264680,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make yourself obey one set\nof rules rather than another,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269059,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the question is, what sort of rules"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270602,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would you wire yourself to obey?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272437,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what you would do is\nyou would make yourself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274815,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the kind of creature that\nsort of always acts in line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278193,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the commitments that\nwould've been good to form"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282072,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had you even known about the problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283782,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're in a situation\nlike the Newcomb case,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286660,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would end up finding yourself think,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288495,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"If I had been able to\nmake a pre-commitment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1291331,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what pre-commitment would've\nbeen the good one to make?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1293792,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The good pre-commitment to make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1295168,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would've been to be a one-boxer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297337,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since I've already wired myself up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300549,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be the kind of person that lives up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303343,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to all the pre-commitments\nI would've made,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305637,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I'm already, in effect,\ncommitted to one-boxing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308390,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though I didn't realize it.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310100,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I love this approach, because for me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311601,
    "dDurationMs": 4130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that kind of makes it an iterated problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1315731,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but maybe more an\niterated problem in life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1318650,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I don't look at it as a single case"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1321611,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I sort of almost think about it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1323155,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as for every future predictor,\nfor every future case,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326825,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or like, almost building\nyour own reputation, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329453,
    "dDurationMs": 917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330370,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Like, you always wanna live up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331747,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the commitments you've made,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1333582,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so even if you haven't heard of it before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336668,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'd wanna stick to those\nideal pre-commitments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339212,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that you are acting in line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341256,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the best version of yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343633,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that would convince\nme to be a one-boxer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346386,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's rare to convince anyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347554,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to switch on the Newcomb problem. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350140,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The thing is, even if I never run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352100,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into another generous supercomputer again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354561,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "life doesn't end after\nI walk out of that room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357314,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I should always defect\n(audio chimes)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359232,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a one-shot prisoners dilemma"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360692,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I can only gain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1361943,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by betraying the other player.\n(coins clinking)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363487,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when I play multiple\nrounds of the game,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365947,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like in life or in society,\neverything changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369284,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Suddenly, it pays to cooperate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371161,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, being the kind of person that sticks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373538,
    "dDurationMs": 2837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to an ideal pre-commitment is beneficial."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376375,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, maybe I was just a\none-boxer kind of guy all along."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379878,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All it took was a little\nreframing and a new perspective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383382,
    "dDurationMs": 3294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(screen beeping and chirping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386676,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The core of Newcomb's\nparadox is deciding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1389304,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if a strong correlation\nthat you know isn't causal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392265,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should matter in your decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394059,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, the question is, what do you do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395811,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you pick both boxes or do\nyou just pick the mystery box?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399439,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Might be taking the mystery box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1401233,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Mystery box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402067,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I would pick both boxes, I think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403735,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I also pick both boxes, so. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1405278,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'll take the mystery box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407239,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1409032,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so you would pick\njust the mystery box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411243,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and probably get the $1 million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413036,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah.\n- So that's based off,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415122,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess that it's almost\nalways been correct,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1416915,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there's this correlation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418667,
    "dDurationMs": 4212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do we think that correlation\nis the same as causation?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1422879,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But how can you tease\nout what's causation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1425215,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what's just correlation?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1427175,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a difficult problem\nthat has applications"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429344,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "far beyond thought experiments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431430,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, how can you tell\nwhether a drug really works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1434766,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or if any beneficial effects are simply"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437602,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "due to random chance?\n(screen chirping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439688,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Big questions like these\ncombined with hands-on learning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442357,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is what I love about\ntoday's sponsor, Brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444943,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It forces me to slow\ndown and actually think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1447404,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of just nodding\nalong with an explanation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450907,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant helps you build\nskills in math and coding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454119,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with step-by-step interactive lessons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456538,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're not just watching,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457664,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're actively solving problems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1459458,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and testing your ideas as you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461501,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I found their courses to\nbe both fun and effective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464629,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, whether you want to explore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1465964,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how to master the math of probability,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467799,
    "dDurationMs": 1502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "start coding in Python,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469301,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or really understand how AI works,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472012,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant will help you achieve"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473346,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your learning goals.\n(audio chimes)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474723,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And their lessons start\nyou at the right level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1476975,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "based on your background,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1478101,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so no matter if you're 10 or 110,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481396,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the practice sets and\nreviews are customized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483940,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to help you advance at your ideal pace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486818,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, how can you tell if\na drug really does work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489946,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, Brilliant's course\non Bayesian probability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492157,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "goes through that exact problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494242,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the best part is, you\nbuild up your intuition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496912,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while you figure out the answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1498705,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By training your problem solving muscles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1500832,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can take what you learn on Brilliant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502542,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and reason through lots\nof others situations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505629,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, to learn on Brilliant\nfor free for a full 30 days,"
    } ]
  }, {
